WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 41 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-28 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.980
Evelyn, there you are. I was just going to look for you.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.480
What's wrong? You look pale.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.480
I'm fine. Just a little nervous.

4
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.980
No need to be nervous. These are all our old friends.

5
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.480
By the way, Vincent, Chloe went upstairs to look for you just now.

6
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.480
Really? I didn't see her.

7
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.480
Listen up, Vincent. There are a lot of people here today.

8
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.480
Don't do anything out of line.

9
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.480
Of course, Father.

10
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.480
Chloe! Come here.

11
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.480
What's wrong, Chloe? Vincent is right here.

12
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.480
Uncle Arthur, I have something to tell you.

13
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.480
Not now, Chloe. The wedding is about to start.

14
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.210
Alright, my dear. Let's go. Don't keep the guests waiting.

15
00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:48.210
Thank you all for coming today. It has been ten years since Zadora left me.

16
00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:51.210
In these ten years, I have never remarried.

17
00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:56.210
I once thought I would be alone forever, until I met Evelyn.

18
00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:03.210
Dear guests, we are gathered here today to witness the sacred union of Arthur Hart and Evelyn Voss.

19
00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:15.670
Look how well Mr. Arthur and Evelyn match. They are truly a match made in heaven.

20
00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:20.670
If anyone objects to this marriage, please speak now.

21
00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:26.400
Otherwise, you will remain silent forever.

22
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.400
I object!
